 *
 * Issue #2327 Stage B (BUILD-ONLY): same crop as examples/aen/aen-isp-capture/
 * boards/imx335-isp-crop.overlay -- see that file's own comment for the
 * 8/6 derivation (1296x972 native IMX335 2x2-binned output, symmetrically
 * cropped to the 1280x960 this example's overlay-1280x960.conf already
 * budgets SRAM0 for). Applied via -DEXTRA_DTC_OVERLAY_FILE (testcase.yaml's
 * aen_imx335 scenario), layered on top of the board's own auto-picked-up
 * boards/<qualified-board>.overlay.
 */
&isp {
	crop-x0 = <8>;
	crop-y0 = <6>;
};
